// # Templates and static files
//
// A page type's template is templates/<its name in snake_case>.html in its app,
// html/template filling the app's templates/base.html. maago gen checks every
// field, route name and static file a template names.
//
// Template functions (beside text/template's):
//
//   - url: {{url "route_name" .ID}}: the route's path, with its {wildcards} in order.
//   - date: {{date "2006-01-02" .PublishedAt}}: a time in Go's layout, in Config.TimeZone; "" for a nil one.
//   - static: {{static "app/file.css"}}: the hashed URL of a file of an app's static/.
